# Shared styles #shared-styles

:::style {format="yaml"}
h1:
  color: var(--nodx-color-primary)
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--nodx-color-primary)
  padding-bottom: 8px
.metric-grid:
  display: grid
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr))
  gap: 12px
.metric:
  border: 1px solid #d1d5db
  border-radius: 8px
  padding: 12px
  background: #f8fafc
.metric strong:
  display: block
  color: var(--nodx-color-primary)
:::style

::section {.metric-grid}
:::note {.metric}
**Parser**
Canonical AST parity.
:::note

:::note {.metric}
**Renderer**
Safe HTML output.
:::note

:::note {.metric}
**Package**
Stored ZIP assets.
:::note
::section
